# Work case-study source media. The originals are 221MB of full-res stills and
# 60fps video, far too heavy to commit or deploy; the site only ever loads the
# web-sized derivatives in public/work/_web, which stay tracked. The READMEs
# and CASE-STUDY.md files stay tracked too.
public/work/*/screenshots/
public/work/*/videos/
public/work/*/before/
public/work/*/components/
public/work/*/social/
public/work/*/backpack-clips/
